Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Leggett-Garg Inequality", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998433583779833*^9, 3.998433592637039*^9}, {
  3.998433624150463*^9, 
  3.9984336344356976`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c934fb6a-202a-044d-a19f-\
701b039502e0"],

Cell["2-level and 3-level", "Subtitle",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984336466030235`*^9, 
  3.998433662930895*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2e35b169-1e7e-c342-94f1-\
4b3541e3890f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998434320669483*^9, 
  3.9984343222221375`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6d02581f-3b47-024b-92e5-\
07184d4c4d3a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Leggett-Garg inequality is fundamentally a witness of classicality in a \
similar way as the Bell test. Using a set of axioms called ",
 StyleBox["macro-realism, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "we may constrain the out-of-time correlation function of a bounded \
observable. The violation of these constraints naturally implies the absence \
of macro-realism exactly analogous to how the violation of the CHSH \
inequality implies an absence of well-defined local variables in the Bell \
test.\n\nIn this document, we will prove the Leggett-Garg inequality, show an \
example of its violation by a spin-1/2 single particle in a magnetic field, \
and then show how the Legget-Garg inequality can be adapted to witness the \
non-classical dynamics of 3-level systems."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998433909355297*^9, 3.9984339980633125`*^9}, {
  3.9984340318425922`*^9, 3.998434215638012*^9}, {3.9984342554708023`*^9, 
  3.9984342914693623`*^9}, {3.998434337701624*^9, 3.9984343758150578`*^9}, {
  3.998434412894644*^9, 3.998434477038046*^9}, {3.9984345297748775`*^9, 
  3.9984348026953964`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5ab8b623-e688-5946-aa02-\
808d8f02ce87"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Proof of Inequality", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998433689777281*^9, {3.998433776135315*^9, 3.998433796065502*^9}, {
   3.998435908214737*^9, 
   3.9984359090907593`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8a43effa-6b3b-2a47-b10d-\
ac44ddff5914"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Consider a classical system which is imbued with an observable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "07640e9b-3bac-4349-b7f9-693d927180ef"],
 " such that a measurement of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "de6d8452-d015-2449-afb0-6bb533ceefd8"],
 " can only take values of -1 and 1. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998433803359867*^9, 3.998433896248205*^9}, 
   3.998435133324873*^9, {3.9984355916193104`*^9, 3.998435716778166*^9}, 
   3.998435763620283*^9, {3.998436055567354*^9, 
   3.998436060548605*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"252dde86-90d4-2141-ada3-\
c6c9509c6d70"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[Element]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"-1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
     "input" -> "q \\in\\{-1, 1\\}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"5f53d581-c4f1-a44d-8997-a09d0e092828"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9984357691952*^9},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"f73bd16b-4995-c84d-9063-a803977d5869"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As a short hand, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "q_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "aabdc263-bd11-7e4d-9610-ac20a9c2a910"],
 " is the observed ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "932b5284-216e-7c48-89c2-73005a58e310"],
 " at time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2193528c-f1d6-ee40-b9e8-6521f0f75771"],
 ", and similarly for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "q_k", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "83743d8d-8dcc-7f40-bf5f-f45a390bfb23"],
 ". We will assume that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], ">", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "t_k > t_i.", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "afe3357c-2961-0748-835c-8e7f8affe7f4"],
 "The correlation between two measurement events can be given as a sum over \
every possible outcome weighted by the probability of that outcome. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998435783978937*^9, 
  3.9984359507789*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2ce64da5-87a2-8643-847d-c6f8007c36ef"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
        UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
    "input" -> "C_q(t_i, t_k) = \\sum_{q_i, q_k} q_i q_k p_{ik}", "state" -> 
    "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"63860285-1759-e34f-8a7b-71c0f801f12e"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984358541088505`*^9, 3.9984358561312313`*^9}, {
  3.9984359550104675`*^9, 3.9984359590191517`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"402bdced-0665-0444-93b4-1d42903b4541"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "p_{ik}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f61a9632-93c7-9e4f-a865-217f96278059"],
 " is the probability of measuring ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "q_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "232133b7-01a9-6e43-9f13-c00afd609693"],
 " then ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "q_k", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "795e7abe-999c-e247-aff4-e9ada43fefe8"],
 ". \n\nThe principles of macro-realism broadly consist of the two axioms: \n\
1) Observation/measurement of a given system is non-invasive in that it does \
not change the probability of measurement outcomes after the measurement;\n2) \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "eb2a9afc-0425-4f47-a494-5c03ebec185b"],
 " is a well-defined parameter at every time, even if it is not known at \
every time.\n\nUsing these two axioms, we can express ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "(", 
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "C_q(t_i, t_k)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "11975a9e-493c-6041-9c5f-ade7695d9c0b"],
 " equally as a sum over probabilities of observing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a329b4e1-1fa5-2d45-9206-901e921012b1"],
 " at an arbitrary intermediate time between ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "996e3f4b-8f0f-da49-9f2f-d9bd977d98e5"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_k", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "40a7a361-9a6e-e64c-b066-1cce86be69ad"],
 " which we denote ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["j", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_j", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "87751127-fd9c-1f46-9fef-7802dde67e5a"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998435994257824*^9, 
  3.998436427857113*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"81d26675-6d45-c945-966a-\
4908f1347d89"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
        UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["j", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
    "input" -> "C_q(t_i, t_k) = \\sum_{q_i,q_j,q_k} q_iq_k p_{ijk}", "state" -> 
    "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"7cbd8ca5-5bf2-9346-b96e-052dbdaff97a"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998436460605633*^9},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"11f2bcfa-7a8e-e940-bd4c-04a4257391c5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "p_{ijk}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9cb2b8e0-8c6e-4248-a240-1b3d169e4652"],
 " now refers to the probability of measuring the sequence ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["j", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "(q_i, q_j, q_k)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ffe3f831-8669-f948-81b2-1a1167376673"],
 " at their respective times. \n\nNow that this identity has been \
established, consider the following identity."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984365075544796`*^9, 3.9984366040334873`*^9}, {
  3.9984366390661697`*^9, 
  3.998436640173641*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"06421ca0-a16a-2548-b375-\
fe2fd15ffe9e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "q_iq_j + q_jq_k - q_iq_k = q_j(q_i + q_k ) - q_i q_k", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "df2b91dc-4a4b-374d-8eda-358f8197ca5e"],
 "\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "|", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "|", "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "q_iq_j + q_jq_k - q_iq_k \\leq |q_i + q_k | - q_i q_k", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6c8b1189-b4fa-2848-bfe7-9c6c7b9f53bd"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9984366219536247`*^9, {3.9984366629304447`*^9, 3.9984366892429085`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"6a290d0a-6f6d-da4a-92ab-206d0e9b5920"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The second line follows from the first because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", "|", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "|"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "q_j (q_i + q_k) \\leq |q_i + q_k|", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ce6f3dac-c7f0-e344-80c0-72be6b266093"],
 " given ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"|", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "|", "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "|q_j| = 1", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "230379b4-f2f2-c144-8b3d-d9bff1c49e0d"],
 ".\n\nIt can be shown exhaustively that "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984366967360897`*^9, 3.9984367163804073`*^9}, {
  3.998436999884844*^9, 
  3.9984370636563225`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f0a23ab0-4299-c747-8734-\
5fafe438a014"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "|", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "|", "-", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
    "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "g_{ik} = |q_i + q_k | - q_i q_k = 1", "state" -> 
    "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"f73a52e9-76c6-6947-be3b-d44850c07195"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998437073168194*^9, 3.9984371034027367`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"a754ac8d-8d82-9543-ad3f-c9922f572781"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "for all combinations of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[Element]", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"-1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q_i, q_k \\in \\{-1, 1\\}", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8e0b84e0-87e1-2441-aa7f-58a020024781"],
 ". Therefore, "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984371109390545`*^9, 
  3.9984371373470974`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7201d99f-2e16-344d-bb61-\
f1bdaf1cab88"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "+", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
    "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q_iq_j + q_jq_k - q_iq_k \\leq g_{ik } = 1", 
    "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"5f651252-37f7-9b48-b26f-c82bcb4fe87c"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9984371548364067`*^9},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"32615991-4161-4c4b-9a9f-ee1f654b4210"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We can finish the proof by multiplying both sides by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{
          StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "p_{ijk}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6dda99f2-182c-c749-a98b-347390a68ef7"],
 " and then summing over all possibilities of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], ",", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "q_{i}, q_j, q_k.", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1b6fc5e0-e074-a544-81d0-d72c6311df67"],
 " Using the formula for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "(", 
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "C_q(t_i, t_j)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "36b0cba0-3cea-5048-87d4-190aa6bec186"],
 " gives"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984371725654984`*^9, 
  3.9984372381583824`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d31308ed-4466-5c40-b397-\
f340912576e0"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "+", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["j", "TI"]], ",", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "-", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ",", 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}], 
      TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
    "C_q(q_i, q_j) + C_q(q_j, q_k) - C_q(q_i, q_k) \\leq 1", "state" -> 
    "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"c5eed38a-7306-6c45-a43f-416811472aee"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984372508360233`*^9, 3.998437252898054*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"e656cca0-e550-7f42-8fc0-5c654702a06a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "If we assume that our system is time-translation invariant and pick ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0", ",", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ",", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "2", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "t_i = 0, t_j = t, t_k = 2t", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d8f9738d-7345-9544-97ba-691f2ed8da3b"],
 ", then we are left with the familiar form of the Leggett-Garg inequality"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998437288659191*^9, 
  3.9984373817940025`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7bfdb7fd-be74-584f-bce8-\
aa6655b4bcb6"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["K", "TI"], "2"], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "2", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "-", 
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}], 
      TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
    "K_2(t) = 2C_q(t) - C_q(2t) \\leq 1", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"b61dc8f6-a086-be4e-952a-e8d79599fcd2"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998437352737171*^9, 3.998437428136156*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"53767274-ecb5-e84d-9d75-d82ba0323c2a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For this inequality to be violated, one or both of the principles of \
macro-realism must be absent. Quantum mechanical systems intrinsically do not \
obey principles of macro-realism since the values of observables are not \
well-defined between measurements, and observations are not non-invasive. \
However, this does not imply that every quantum system violates the above \
inequality at some time, only that the correlation function of operators that \
evolve quantum mechanically are not constrained by the same inequality. For \
example, the principal identity used in the proof above is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "\[LessEqual]", "|", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "|"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "q_j (q_i + q_k) \\leq |q_i + q_k|", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f42ec773-1f2a-da41-89c1-b0c6259873f5"],
 " holds for any ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "\[Element]", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"-1", ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q_j \\in [-1, 1]", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c9062f11-dacb-9643-af1d-5216ff932420"],
 ", however, the Leggett-Garg correlation function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["K", "TI"], "2"], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "K_2(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4bc167d1-641a-9546-9858-a97f5a836c93"],
 " for a continuous quantum observable is all but guaranteed to satisfy the \
above inequality. This simply arises from the fact that, for a continuous \
variable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "q", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "922b7dfc-6152-184e-8a44-bf4b2d6c1247"],
 ", the average difference between ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "and", "|", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "|"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "q_j (q_i + q_k) \\text{and} |q_i + q_k|", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8116d4ae-2624-5c49-9f4f-f7c5ee799e4e"],
 " is often significant. Therefore, as corollary to the notion of the \
Leggett-Garg bound qua witness of non-classical evolution, the dynamics of \
quantum correlations which obey the above inequality are not prohibited from \
being effectively modeled via variables which obey principles of \
macro-realism. \n\nNow, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s turn to the canonical example \
of non-classical dynamical evolution: A spin-1/2 in a magnetic field."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984374566644516`*^9, 3.9984377840565224`*^9}, {
  3.9984378217218018`*^9, 3.9984378563306713`*^9}, {3.998437891091387*^9, 
  3.9984379931271877`*^9}, {3.9984381077878456`*^9, 3.998438302208973*^9}, {
  3.9984383601922417`*^9, 3.998438700597828*^9}, {3.998438761406925*^9, 
  3.998438850615366*^9}, {3.9985777902286663`*^9, 3.9985778240523167`*^9}, {
  3.99857794676725*^9, 3.99857794862961*^9}, {3.9985780005317097`*^9, 
  3.9985780332961006`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"918f7f6f-7fd0-9e43-9328-\
433216992825"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Spin-1/2 ", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998578051270651*^9, 
  3.998578061603018*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"db4a2b53-512a-e341-8141-\
0e1a61f72cde"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Setup", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99857869524885*^9, 3.9985787315643272`*^9}, {
  3.998579030531845*^9, 3.998579034112192*^9}, {3.998579064184807*^9, 
  3.998579064882427*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fac1dbdd-c57e-9b4a-acf3-\
d9702611d784"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Hilbert Space", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99857964835898*^9, 
  3.9985796511035633`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e88fcaaa-2678-fe4f-9f62-\
4d64057c6e62"],

Cell["\<\
Represent the two spin outcomes as normal vectors in the Hilbert space\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998579080211479*^9, 
  3.9985791101510105`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"25905945-57e2-1346-a63a-\
c2ce8e466bc1"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sup", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sdown", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"StateVec", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"Sup", ",", " ", "Sdown"}], "}"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985791125808887`*^9, 3.998579140183922*^9}, {
  3.998579196319359*^9, 3.998579216611456*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[225]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9a40df36-5b1b-f94d-aa61-547cdcbfe8bf"],

Cell["And the observables are the Pauli operators", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985791440471687`*^9, 
  3.998579155986578*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0d5e372e-ee8c-0f49-80af-\
71ab07ae5ff4"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sz", " ", "=", 
   RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sx", " ", "=", 
   RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Sy", " ", "=", 
   RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Id", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Svec", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"Sx", ",", " ", "Sy", ",", " ", "Sz"}], "}"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985791921874065`*^9, 3.9985792226168633`*^9}, {
  3.998580347815569*^9, 3.9985803568245163`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[228]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d16440be-aea1-5a49-a5aa-0e1c2939e5e7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Hamiltonian of a spin 1/2 in a magnetic field oriented along the z-axis \
is just the ",
 Cell[BoxData["Sz"], "Input",
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985791921874065`*^9, 3.9985792226168633`*^9}},
  ExpressionUUID->"f59daae9-b896-5742-abe2-dd00587ed936"],
 " operators. We will set the strength of the magnetic field to 1 for \
simplicity."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985786790447235`*^9, 3.9985786801791096`*^9}, {
  3.9985792305903416`*^9, 
  3.998579327202919*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e0d6609e-5d49-1c45-aca1-\
ec15cbacf498"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"H", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"-", "Sz"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"H", "//", "MatrixForm"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985793295501785`*^9, 3.9985793328126926`*^9}, {
   3.998580071232689*^9, 3.9985800785351048`*^9}, 3.998580164071419*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[233]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6727a0ad-bb16-f446-a75c-2ecf027ab073"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "0"},
     {"0", "1"}
    },
    GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
         Offset[0.7]}, 
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
        Offset[0.2], {
         Offset[0.4]}, 
        Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}],
  Function[BoxForm`e$, 
   MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985800717870464`*^9, 3.9985800789799023`*^9}, 
   3.998580164572706*^9, 3.998654502509691*^9, 3.9986548185165043`*^9, 
   3.998655330154089*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[234]//MatrixForm=",ExpressionUUID->"419a2855-887e-6347-9cc6-\
e550b3ab99be"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The expectation value of any observable is then given by a trace over the \
thermal density of states.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998579358312788*^9, 3.9985793949613113`*^9}, {
  3.998579579319435*^9, 
  3.998579597261156*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3725cd74-51a7-c54e-8289-\
ea1bdb7fe801"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Z", "[", "\[Beta]_", "]"}], " ", ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "\[Beta]"}], " ", "H"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rho", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H_", ",", "\[Beta]_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"1", "/", 
     RowBox[{"Z", "[", "\[Beta]", "]"}]}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
        RowBox[{"S", ",", "S"}], "]"}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "\[Beta]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"S", ".", "H", ".", "S"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"S", ",", "StateVec"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ThermalStateExpectation", "[", 
   RowBox[{"H_", ",", "\[Beta]_", ",", "op_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"rho", "[", 
     RowBox[{"H", ",", "\[Beta]"}], "]"}], ".", "op"}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9985793557698727`*^9, {3.99858008733704*^9, 3.9985801415031433`*^9}, {
   3.998580199425024*^9, 3.998580199710823*^9}, {3.9985902825616055`*^9, 
   3.9985902841304626`*^9}, {3.998590331816515*^9, 3.998590333379532*^9}, {
   3.998654419932724*^9, 3.9986544212310925`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[235]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8d785274-77f5-bf4d-b1b3-a5a5b980ee05"],

Cell["\<\
Small temperatures (large \[Beta]) favor states which align with the field.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998580147023548*^9, 
  3.9985802031817207`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b44cce47-6660-2f47-af46-\
9013b7bd3688"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rho", "[", "2", "]"}], "//", "MatrixForm"}], "//", "N"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[238]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b4a48f7e-ca18-1442-bcbd-9e395b56d8f6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
     {"0.9820137900379086`", "0.`"},
     {"0.`", "0.017986209962091562`"}
    },
    GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
         Offset[0.7]}, 
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
        Offset[0.2], {
         Offset[0.4]}, 
        Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}],
  Function[BoxForm`e$, 
   MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998580206196495*^9, 3.9986545025363293`*^9, 
  3.9986548186135464`*^9, 3.9986553301698914`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[238]//MatrixForm=",ExpressionUUID->"d9bc2ad6-b8e9-e449-b652-\
550b2429fad9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["Large temperatures (small \[Beta]) equally weight each state.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985802079199677`*^9, 
  3.9985802377793446`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0e6e7bda-6cea-f046-b602-\
e43a6f099db4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rho", "[", "0.01", "]"}], "//", "MatrixForm"}], "//", 
  "N"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985802402328625`*^9, 3.9985802469366417`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[239]:=",ExpressionUUID->"60be73bb-59ff-fe45-9fa4-5901ed76d6d8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
     {"0.5049998333399996`", "0.`"},
     {"0.`", "0.4950001666600003`"}
    },
    GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Center}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`], {
         Offset[0.7]}, 
        Offset[0.27999999999999997`]}, "Rows" -> {
        Offset[0.2], {
         Offset[0.4]}, 
        Offset[0.2]}}], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}],
  Function[BoxForm`e$, 
   MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9985802473069534`*^9, 3.9986545025403557`*^9, 
  3.9986548186674614`*^9, 3.9986553301698914`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[239]//MatrixForm=",ExpressionUUID->"cf2a49cf-da98-df4e-9c4d-\
468997685024"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["LG Bound", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985796644402084`*^9, 3.9985796675305424`*^9}, {
  3.998599524501652*^9, 
  3.9985995306078434`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"65326137-a707-144c-9544-\
fdf45a331666"],

Cell["\<\
If the observable commutes with the Hamiltonian, then it will evolve \
trivially in time. We will measure the spin in the x-z plane on an angle \
\[Theta] from the z-axis. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99857962098242*^9, 3.998579622467413*^9}, {
  3.9985796882983303`*^9, 3.998579754474352*^9}, {3.998579860449951*^9, 
  3.998579928624943*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5914e265-0039-f147-9f2a-\
cd5c3f2d171d"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"U", "[", 
   RowBox[{"H_", ",", "t_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "H", " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Udag", " ", "[", 
   RowBox[{"H_", ",", "t_"}], "]"}], ":=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"U", "[", 
   RowBox[{"H", ",", 
    RowBox[{"-", "t"}]}], "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"S\[Theta]SpinHalf", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\[Theta]_", ",", "t_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Udag", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H", ",", "t"}], "]"}], ".", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Theta]", "]"}], "Sx"}], " ", "+", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Theta]", "]"}], "Sz"}]}], ")"}], ".", 
   RowBox[{"U", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998579943488325*^9, 3.9985800371846085`*^9}, {
  3.9985803257035637`*^9, 3.998580328301752*^9}, {3.9985803627146187`*^9, 
  3.998580419171625*^9}, {3.99858549677462*^9, 3.998585497100258*^9}, {
  3.998590246639889*^9, 3.998590271398237*^9}, {3.998590347581482*^9, 
  3.9985903772826557`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[240]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3e048841-eaf3-1a46-a5b2-42648a3ff77b"],

Cell["\<\
Measurements act as projection operators which are unitary in a \
two-dimensional Hilbert space. The simple projection operator is\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998580290164364*^9, 3.9985803191665955`*^9}, {
  3.9985804513454456`*^9, 3.998580485797266*^9}, {3.9985805374927197`*^9, 
  3.998580575425314*^9}, {3.998585510816019*^9, 
  3.9985855205121174`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e0c0a51e-d0f0-8444-b43e-\
5f3bdb0143dd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalPi]S\[Theta]2Level", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\[Theta]_", ",", "t_", ",", "q_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"Id", " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"q", " ", 
      RowBox[{"S\[Theta]SpinHalf", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ",", " ", "t"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985891733706036`*^9, 3.9985891767066383`*^9}, {
  3.998590454089567*^9, 3.998590457341749*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[243]:=",ExpressionUUID->"bffecce7-0f22-4841-9ca0-fd12b854c18d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We can measure the time correlation function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "(", 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "C_q(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0cb2e025-e76f-2a45-9bde-896e83400848"],
 " two ways.\n1) Explicitly calculate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["q", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], LimitsPositioning -> True], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["j", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "C_q(t) = \\sum_{q_iq_j} q_iq_j p_{ij}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "44a8ca56-9f01-f34c-b9fc-176d26681e36"],
 "  using explicit calculations of the probability of measuring the dual \
event. We call this the strong measure technique. The strong measurement \
technique is a valid construction of the exact value of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
        RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "(", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
      "input" -> "C_q(t)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
     "TeXAssistantTemplate"], " "}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "941b4eea-dce9-2345-bcc5-0fbab9543076"],
 " for any n-level system as long as the projector can be defined.\n\n2) \
Couple the system to a pair of qubits, and gain information about the system \
by measuring the qubits instead of directly measuring the system. We call \
this the weak measure technique and it is equivalent to calculating the \
following quantum correlation function "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985855394150295`*^9, 3.9985857279461613`*^9}, {
  3.9985883292792206`*^9, 3.998588341562237*^9}, {3.9985884330254936`*^9, 
  3.998588459709635*^9}, {3.9985895147290707`*^9, 
  3.998589517934822*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2db91659-7e37-e344-a0ca-\
a2919cdb650f"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
      RowBox[{
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["M", "TI"]}]], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "Tr", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"\[Rho]", 
            FractionBox["1", "2"], 
            RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
                StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                  StyleBox["t", "TI"], ")"}], ",", 
                StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
    "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
    "C_q^{WM}(t) = \\text{Tr}[\\rho \\frac{1}{2}\\{Q(t), Q\\}]", "state" -> 
    "Boxes"|>,
   "TeXAssistantTemplate"], 
  TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"cededa08-80dd-af45-9356-4a2e94f0c019"]], \
"Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998588767494053*^9},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"afdcbfaa-c179-d142-ac83-f1f2badc8ddf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"CWeakMeasure", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\[Beta]_", ",", "op_", ",", "t_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
   RowBox[{"ThermalStateExpectation", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "\[Beta]", ",", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"op", "[", "0", "]"}], ".", 
          RowBox[{"op", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "+", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"op", "[", "t", "]"}], ".", 
          RowBox[{"op", "[", "0", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], 
    "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985898052026176`*^9, 3.9985898562219963`*^9}, {
  3.9985902317158585`*^9, 3.9985902354833393`*^9}, {3.998590680341736*^9, 
  3.9985907017575665`*^9}, {3.9986544403243427`*^9, 3.9986544406937656`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[244]:=",ExpressionUUID->"88ec036b-749d-a147-af3f-1372d2ecc3b5"],

Cell["\<\
For 2-level systems, the weak measure and the strong measure time correlation \
functions are equivalent.

We pick the direction of measurement to be the x-axis. The correlation \
function for the spin-1/2 in a magnetic field is\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998588913778557*^9, 3.9985889452171783`*^9}, {
  3.998589002255533*^9, 3.9985890690320587`*^9}, {3.998589559805992*^9, 
  3.998589562210758*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9802c1a2-f9f3-4848-ad8d-\
363d84e4256e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"CWeakMeasure", "[", 
      RowBox[{"0.1", ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"S\[Theta]SpinHalf", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "#"}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", "t"}], 
      "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
      RowBox[{"2", "t"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"t", ",", "0", ",", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", "Pi"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1.1"}], ",", "1.1"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", "->", "\"\<Expressions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"AxesLabel", "->", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "None"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9985890807086773`*^9, {3.9985891136443863`*^9, 3.998589115648823*^9}, {
   3.9985891879718456`*^9, 3.998589189696247*^9}, {3.9985892583540726`*^9, 
   3.9985893179794846`*^9}, {3.9985895308711243`*^9, 3.998589531370369*^9}, 
